{"book":"kinney","chapter":"storybook","chapterTitle":"بناء أنظمة التصميم في Storybook","slug":"callout-component-exercise","title":"تنفيذ مكوّن Callout","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"الألوان","text":"الألوان"},{"depth":3,"id":"ملاحظات-تذوق-أخرى","text":"ملاحظات تذوّق أخرى"},{"depth":2,"id":"بعض-الشيفرة-الابتدائية","text":"بعض الشيفرة الابتدائية"}],"html":"<p>حسنًا، جاء دورك لتجربة هذا. تأمّل <a href=\"https://www.figma.com/file/Qhb4PJucNK8bgvf4N65Jrm/Anthology?type=design&amp;node-id=2-2372&amp;mode=design\">مكوّن Callout</a>. وتأمّل ما يلي. ويمكنك أن تختار تجاهل كونها بأيقونات مختلفة إن أردت.</p>\n<p>تصميمات مكوّن Callout</p>\n<h2 id=\"الألوان\">الألوان</h2>\n<p>يستخدم مكوّن Callout الألوان التالية من سمتنا.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>الاسم</th>\n<th>الفاتح</th>\n<th>الداكن</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Callout / Primary</strong></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>الخلفية</td>\n<td>Primary/200</td>\n<td>Primary/800</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>الحد</td>\n<td>Primary/500</td>\n<td>Primary/900</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>النص</td>\n<td>Primary/900</td>\n<td>Primary/50</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Callout / Information</strong></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>الخلفية</td>\n<td>Information/200</td>\n<td>Information/800</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>الحد</td>\n<td>Information/500</td>\n<td>Information/500</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>النص</td>\n<td>Information/900</td>\n<td>Information/50</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Callout / Success</strong></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>الخلفية</td>\n<td>Success/200</td>\n<td>Success/800</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>الحد</td>\n<td>Success/500</td>\n<td>Success/900</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>النص</td>\n<td>Success/900</td>\n<td>Success/50</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Callout / Warning</strong></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>الخلفية</td>\n<td>Warning/200</td>\n<td>Warning/800</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>الحد</td>\n<td>Warning/500</td>\n<td>Warning/900</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>النص</td>\n<td>Warning/900</td>\n<td>Warning/50</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Callout / Danger</strong></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>الخلفية</td>\n<td>Danger/200</td>\n<td>Danger/800</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>الحد</td>\n<td>Danger/500</td>\n<td>Danger/900</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>النص</td>\n<td>Danger/900</td>\n<td>Danger/50</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Callout / Default</strong></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>الخلفية</td>\n<td>Slate/200</td>\n<td>Slate/800</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>الحد</td>\n<td>Slate/500</td>\n<td>Slate/900</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>النص</td>\n<td>Slate/900</td>\n<td>Slate/50</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"ملاحظات-تذوق-أخرى\">ملاحظات تذوّق أخرى</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>الخطوط هي الخط الأساسي، لكن عنوان مكوّن Callout بوزن شبه عريض.</li>\n<li>الزوايا مستديرة باستخدام صنف <code>rounded</code> في Tailwind.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"بعض-الشيفرة-الابتدائية\">بعض الشيفرة الابتدائية</h2>\n<p>إليك بعض الشيفرة لتبدأ إن كان ذلك مفيدًا. لنبدأ بالمكوّن.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">PropsWithChildren</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;react&#x27;</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { cva, <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">VariantProps</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;class-variance-authority&#x27;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">CalloutProps</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">PropsWithChildren</span>&lt;{ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">title</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span> }&gt; &amp; <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">VariantProps</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> variants&gt;;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> variants = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">cva</span>([<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;p-4&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;rounded&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;border&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;shadow-md&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;space-y-4&#x27;</span>]);\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">Callout</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\">{ title, children }: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">CalloutProps</span></span>) =&gt; (\n  <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">className</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{variants({})}</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">className</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;font-semibold&quot;</span>&gt;</span>{title}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>{children}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span></span>\n);\n</code></pre>\n<p>والآن للقصة (يُفضّل في <code>src/components/callout/callout.stores.tsx</code>):</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Meta</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">StoryObj</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;@storybook/react&#x27;</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Callout</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;./callout&#x27;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> meta = {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">title</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Components/Callout&#x27;</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">component</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Callout</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">args</span>: {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">title</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;An Important Message&#x27;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">children</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;This is a message that you should read.&#x27;</span>,\n  },\n} <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">satisfies</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Meta</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Callout</span>&gt;;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">default</span> meta;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Story</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">StoryObj</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Callout</span>&gt;;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Default</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Story</span> = {};\n</code></pre>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>الحل</strong></p>\n<p>بعد أن تسنح لك الفرصة لتنفيذ هذا المكوّن وكتابة قصة، سننظر في حل ممكن <a href=\"https://stevekinney.com/courses/storybook/callout-component-solution\">هنا</a>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n"}